1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
You think these floating mountains are CGI from Avatar.
{\fs13}I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,500
They're real — and you can stand right under them.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:10,000
Zhangjiajie, in Hunan: over 3,000 quartz-sandstone pillars.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
One inspired Avatar — so in 2010 China renamed it "Avatar Hallelujah Mountain".

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Movie CGI, or the realest landscape in China? Tell me I'm wrong.
